 status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHZEKI, HIDEKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKADA, KENJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI, KOHICHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHZEKI HIDEKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKADA KENJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI KOHICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHZEKI, HIDEKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKADA, KENJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI, KOHICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A disk drive, method of producing the same, and disk drive controller are provided with little increase of cost at an improved yield. An HDC (20) finds the current position of a head (2) to perform track following control based on the reproduction output of a servosector from a channel (5) and performs computation about servo data by using an integration parameter corresponding to the target track which is read and stored in a RAM (1) and the current position of the head (2).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un lecteur de disque, son procédé de production, et un contrôleur de lecteur de disque obtenus avec une légère augmentation de coût et un meilleur rendement. Une HDLC (20) localise la position actuelle d'une tête de lecture (2) pour entamer sa poursuite après contrôle, sur la base de la puissance de reproduction d'un servo-secteur de canal (5). De plus, cette HDLC calcule les données de servocommande en utilisant un paramètre d'intégration correspondant à la poursuite de la cible lue et mémorisée dans une mémoire RAM (1), et à la position actuelle de la tête de lecture (2).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>